{
  "name": "stage3_head_to_head",
  "description": "The 2 finalists on the v1.1 test split (292 cases): one greedy run for the main score plus 3 runs at the deployment temperature (0.3) for pass^3. Pick the 2 finalists' runs with --only (both the _greedy and _t03 entries). Change quant/model_path if a finalist's best quant is Q8_0. Check model_path values against your models/ folder; filenames follow model_registry.csv. Added after Stage 2: qwen35-2b_q8_0_vulkan_v11_greedy, a greedy-only tie-breaker for the 2B quant (Q8 vs Q4 was +4.7 pts, CI [-0.9, +11.3] on 106 cases). Also added: gemma4-e2b_q8_0_vulkan_v11_greedy, greedy only, because Gemma Q8 tied Qwen-2B Q8 on 106 cases (-7.5, CI [-17.0, +0.9]). Added after Stage 3: qwen35-2b_bf16_vulkan_v11_greedy, because Qwen-2B Q8 beat Q4 (+6.2, CI [+1.4, +11.0]), which met the BF16 rule set before Stage 1.",
